  <item>
    <title>36 害，不就是离个职嘛~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c7f9932c82c9dcca7ba2b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c7f9932c82c9dcca7ba2b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 11:36:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近日，大玉裸辞了，职场牛马重回久违的草原，自由的味道直冲天灵盖！本期节目借着辞职的契机，跟大家一起聊聊打工人离职的那些事儿，有点走心、有点直接、有点犀利、有点难题，看看成年人如何边抬头望月亮，变低头捡地上的六便士吧！无论如何，向自由致敬~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> </span><strong><span>近日裸辞真相：再靠谱的牛马也有崩盘的一天</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大厂背后的制度BUG</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>与教官级BOOS的工作体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>非一日积压的离职内因</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> </span><strong><span>离职回忆录：想离职总有一万个的理由</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>人在职场，总有渣男厌倦心态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>带薪自习的神仙日子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>职场老炮还能说走就走吗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> </span><strong><span>代际观念冲突：我裸辞爽了，家人却“疯了”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>裸辞=人生险棋？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>代际理解是奢侈品，课题分离为上策</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>成年人，终究要为自己负起责任</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">49:08</a> </span><strong><span>GAP 之后：自由很贵，但暂停很值</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>我没有离职后的“To do list”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>思路打开，寻找灵活生存方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不需要奔向旷野，需要内在平衡</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6587c193f123d41c13deddc2/loW3ByU5bgB7bLDQCfEB6WoHEXEf.m4a" length="59361478" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiR6Zd5FtmCe-lfeIYQcdyviaRaq.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>35 钱，可不能就这么算了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ade38d293471fed49e7e83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ade38d293471fed49e7e83</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 20:00:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们谈钱不伤感情，聊聊</span><strong><span>关于花钱理财的“小心思”和“大局观”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>听完可能想立刻翻账本、查存款，或者……直接开个家庭财政会议......</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容概览】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> </span><strong><span>金钱观是怎样炼成的？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>记账到底有什么魔力？月光族如何突然“觉醒”</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来我们对金钱的态度，早就藏在过往的经历中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> </span><strong><span>钱，怎么花？怎么理？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>分享普通人的收支分配方法，不一定科学，但很真实</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是“不接受亏损”还是“玩转理财不躺平”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> </span><strong><span>辩论现场——家庭财政到底谁来掌权？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“我必须管！”VS“我才不管！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>观点大混战，管钱到底是爱、是控制、还是无奈</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6587c193f123d41c13deddc2/lloDvzzSPqc-idz9ESUivCUQLpH7.m4a" length="74162330" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:07</itunes:duration>
